"className\":\"mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-amber-800\",\"children\":\"This is a simple repeating-path approximation, not a full thermal-bridge calculation. Junction Ψ-values, point bridges, fixings and complex inhomogeneous elements can require a specialist method.\"}]]}]\n6:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-black text-slate-950\",\"children\":\"4. Insulation thickness and quantity\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"my-3 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-4 py-3 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-slate-900\",\"children\":\"R_additional = max(0, R_target − R_existing)\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"my-3 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-4 py-3 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-slate-900\",\"children\":\"thickness = R_additional × λ\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"my-3 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-4 py-3 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-slate-900\",\"children\":\"volume = area × thickness\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"my-3 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-4 py-3 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-slate-900\",\"children\":\"mass = volume × installed density\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700\",\"children\":\"Product package counts are only produced when product-specific coverage or package-mass data is entered. Loose-fill coverage and settlement can be manufacturer-specific, so the engine does not invent a universal bags-per-area rule.\"}]]}]\n7:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-black text-slate-950\",\"children\":\"5. Design heat loss\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"my-3 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-4 py-3 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-slate-900\",\"children\":\"H_fabric = Σ(U × area)   [W/K]\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"my-3 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-4 py-3 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-slate-900\",\"children\":\"Q_fabric = H_fabric × ΔT\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"my-3 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-4 py-3 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-slate-900\",\"children\":\"H_air ≈ 0.333 × V × [ACH_infiltration + ACH_ventilation × (1 − heat-recovery efficiency)]\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"my-3 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-4 py-3 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-slate-900\",\"children\":\"Q_total = (H_fabric + H_vent) × ΔT\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"className\":\"font-bold text-emerald-700 underline\",\"href\":\"https://www.iso.org/standard/65713.html\",\"children\":\"ISO 13789:2017\"}],\" provides methods and conventions for steady-state transmission and ventilation heat-transfer coefficients. In V1, uncontrolled infiltration and intentional/mechanical ventilation are entered separately so heat recovery is applied only to the ventilation airflow. The V1 calculator is a transparent planning implementation, not a claim of complete project certification under that standard.\"]}]]}]\n8:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-black text-slate-950\",\"children\":\"6. Degree-day annual energy\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"my-3 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-4 py-3 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-slate-900\",\"children\":\"Annual delivered energy ≈ H_total × degree-days × 24 ÷ 1000\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"my-3 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-4 py-3 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-slate-900\",\"children\":\"Purchased energy ≈ delivered energy ÷ performance factor\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700\",\"children\":[\"This is a simplified degree-day estimate. It does not model hourly solar gains, internal gains, humidity, controls or dynamic thermal mass. \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"className\":\"font-bold text-emerald-700 underline\",\"href\":\"https://www.iso.org/standard/65696.html\",\"children\":\"ISO 52016-1:2017\"}],\" covers more detailed procedures for heating/cooling energy needs and internal temperatures; this V1 does not claim to be a full ISO 52016 simulation.\"]}]]}]\n9:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-black text-slate-950\",\"children\":\"7. Cost and carbon payback\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"my-3 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-4 py-3 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-slate-900\",\"children\":\"Annual cost saving = purchased energy saved × local energy price\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"my-3 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-4 py-3 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-slate-900\",\"children\":\"Annual CO₂e saving = purchased energy saved × operational carbon factor\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"my-3 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-4 py-3 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-slate-900\",\"children\":\"Financial payback = upgrade cost ÷ annual cost saving\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"my-3 overflow-x-auto rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-4 py-3 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-slate-900\",\"children\":\"Carbon payback = embodied carbon ÷ annual operational CO₂e saving\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700\",\"children\":\"No generic embodied-carbon factor is silently bundled. Use total project carbon from an LCA/EPD calculation, or a compatible product EPD factor with the correct declared unit and life-cycle scope.\"}]]}]\na:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-black text-slate-950\",\"children\":\"8. Regional guidance\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700\",\"children\":[\"The initial regional dataset includes optional U.S. retrofit guidance from \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"className\":\"font-bold text-emerald-700 underline\",\"href\":\"https://www.energystar.gov/saveathome/seal_insulate/identify-problems-you-want-fix/diy-checks-inspections/insulation-r-values\",\"children\":\"ENERGY STAR's Recommended Home Insulation R-Values\"}],\". It is explicitly labelled as U.S. guidance and is not reused as a worldwide code table.\"]}]]}]\nb:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-black text-slate-950\",\"children\":\"9. Data updates: monitored, validated, versioned\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3 leading-7 text-slate-700\",\"children\":\"Stable equations are not changed automatically. Source pages are monitored by a source-health script; material/guidance changes must pass dataset validation and regression tests before a new version is activated. If monitoring fails, the website continues using the last validated local dataset.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-700\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"font-black text-slate-950\",\"children\":\"Safe update sequence\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 font-mono\",\"children\":\"Source change → review → new version → dataset validation → engine regression tests → build → activation\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2\",\"children\":\"No external source can overwrite production calculation values directly.\"}]]}]]}]\nc:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-black text-slate-950\",\"children\":\"10. Known limits\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 leading-7 text-slate-700\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"Not a universal building-code compliance certificate.\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"No condensation/interstitial moisture or hygrothermal simulation.\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"No ground-contact method, glazing model or curtain-wall calculation in V1.\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"No full linear/point thermal-bridge or 2D/3D heat-flow solver.\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"No automatic local energy-price or grid-carbon factor: users enter current local values to avoid stale global assumptions.\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":\"No automatic EPD factor substitution without unit/scope validation.\"}]]}]]}]\nd:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50 p-5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xl font-black text-emerald-950\",\"children\":\"Version and review policy\"}],[\"$\",\"dl\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 grid gap-3 text-sm sm:grid-cols-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"dt\",null,{\"className\":\"font-bold text-emerald-800\",\"children\":\"Engine version\"}],[\"$\",\"dd\",null,{\"className\":\"font-black text-emerald-950\",\"children\":\"1.0.0\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"dt\",null,{\"className\":\"font-bold text-emerald-800\",\"children\":\"Material dataset\"}],[\"$\",\"dd\",null,{\"className\":\"font-black text-emerald-950\",\"children\":[\"2026.09.1\",\" · reviewed \",\"2026-09-05\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"dt\",null,{\"className\":\"font-bold text-emerald-800\",\"children\":\"Guidance dataset\"}],[\"$\",\"dd\",null,{\"className\":\"font-black text-emerald-950\",\"children\":[\"2026.09.1\",\" · reviewed \",\"2026-09-05\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"dt\",null,{\"className\":\"font-bold text-emerald-800\",\"children\":\"Source monitoring\"}],[\"$\",\"dd\",null,{\"className\":\"font-black text-emerald-950\",\"children\":\"Automatic health check; calculation changes require validated release\"}]]}]]}]]}]\ne:[\"$\",\"$L1a\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$1b\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@1c\"}]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L1d\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L1e\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$1b\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Building Envelope Methodology | R-Value, U-Value & Heat Loss | Green Engineering Tools\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Methodology, equations, data versions, limitations and update policy for Green Engineering Tools building-envelope, insulation, heat-loss and carbon-payback calculators.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"author\",\"href\":\"https://greenengineeringtools.com\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"3\",{\"name\":\"author\",\"content\":\"Engr. Arsalan Khan\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"4\",{\"name\":\"creator\",\"content\":\"Green Engineering Tools\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"5\",{\"name\":\"publisher\",\"content\":\"Green Engineering Tools\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"6\",{\"name\":\"robots\",\"content\":\"index, follow\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"7\",{\"name\":\"googlebot\",\"content\":\"index, follow, max-video-preview:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"8\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://greenengineeringtools.com/building-envelope/methodology\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"9\",{\"property\":\"og:title\",\"content\":\"Green Engineering Tools\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"10\",{\"property\":\"og:description\",\"content\":\"Free browser-based engineering calculators for carbon, CBAM, building-envelope, electrical systems and sustainable design.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"11\",{\"property\":\"og:url\",\"content\":\"https://greenengine